  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/tool2/). VERDICT: STALE-FIXED. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e. Fixed by 53015c632b (WI-jigup, 2026-10-24): scripts/check-schema-coverage gained --baseline PATH and _BaselineSwap now writes a private tempfile.TemporaryDirectory file passed via --baseline, so the committed .ci/schema-coverage-baseline.json is never touched. Live: `check-schema-coverage --input <tiny survey> --update-baseline --baseline <scratch>/bl.json` exits 0, writes the scratch file, and the committed baseline's sha256 (9e56fd35...) and git status are unchanged. MECHANISM: gate script read a fixed baseline path so tests mutated the shared committed file; now --baseline flag + per-test TemporaryDirectory. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-jigup. PROPOSED DISPOSITION: close (awaiting owner authorization; status unchanged)."  # 1116
